(4316065, 621275, 87502, '<td valign="top">It''s difficult to grade a photograph of someone''s loved ones because you don''t want to feel like you''re devaluing them.  That said, I know you understand this is a photo competition.  I feel that you would have translated the concept of Heaven in a far better way for us viewers had you perhaps taken them outside and let them play . . . any number of things for that matter.  It''s a beautiful portrait however.</td>', 'It''s difficult to grade a photograph of someone''s loved ones because you don''t want to feel like you''re devaluing them.  That said, I know you understand this is a photo competition.  I feel that you would have translated the concept of Heaven in a far better way for us viewers had you perhaps taken them outside and let them play . . . any number of things for that matter.  It''s a beautiful portrait however.', '2007-12-15 13:57:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316071, 620969, 87502, '<td valign="top">Darling baby!!!  a couple of critiques:  being at the same level as the baby would have given us a greater perspective his line.  Better resolution would have preserved detail.  Perhaps a bit more light as well.</td>', 'Darling baby!!!  a couple of critiques:  being at the same level as the baby would have given us a greater perspective his line.  Better resolution would have preserved detail.  Perhaps a bit more light as well.', '2007-12-15 14:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
