(4316085, 621708, 87502, '<td valign="top">I really like this photograph, though, I don''t feel like it''s captured the concept of heaven.  What you have captured is a fantastic sense of emotion, depth and movement.  It''s a wonderful portrait!</td>', 'I really like this photograph, though, I don''t feel like it''s captured the concept of heaven.  What you have captured is a fantastic sense of emotion, depth and movement.  It''s a wonderful portrait!', '2007-12-15 14:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
