(4316840, 621138, 51793, '<td valign="top">I think this is a good idea for the challenge but it''s something that has been done a billion times. Knowing that, I think you could have changed up the shot by adding other props. <br/> <br/>You could have had her looking over a grave or a body. You could have had her standing above someone looking down on them with a ray of light as if she is getting ready to  walk their soul to the pearly gates.<br/> <br/>To me the lighting should also be a bit stronger so that she looks more like a guardian an angle than a dark angel. Her skin looks very dark and dingy. The perception of an angel is bright, clean and very rare.  The use of USM should also be added to the shot so the edges look sharp and crisp. <br/> <br/>Hope that helps some and I wish you the best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think this is a good idea for the challenge but it''s something that has been done a billion times. Knowing that, I think you could have changed up the shot by adding other props.  You could have had her looking over a grave or a body. You could have had her standing above someone looking down on them with a ray of light as if she is getting ready to  walk their soul to the pearly gates. To me the lighting should also be a bit stronger so that she looks more like a guardian an angle than a dark angel. Her skin looks very dark and dingy. The perception of an angel is bright, clean and very rare.  The use of USM should also be added to the shot so the edges look sharp and crisp.  Hope that helps some and I wish you the best of luck in the challenge.', '2007-12-16 09:34:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316842, 621050, 51793, '<td valign="top">This is a very pretty sky. I don''t like the water because it''s so dark but the sky looks very good. You might want to make sure the horizon is level next time before you shoot. This will keep you from having to try and straighten it in processing.</td>', 'This is a very pretty sky. I don''t like the water because it''s so dark but the sky looks very good. You might want to make sure the horizon is level next time before you shoot. This will keep you from having to try and straighten it in processing.', '2007-12-16 09:36:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4316843, 620108, 51793, '<td valign="top">Please tell me they are not sitting on what looks like poop?  I guess if they were than yes they would be in heaven. <br/> <br/>On the other side of things, this is a great macro shot.</td>', 'Please tell me they are not sitting on what looks like poop?  I guess if they were than yes they would be in heaven.  On the other side of things, this is a great macro shot.', '2007-12-16 09:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
