(4316931, 620308, 68599, '<td valign="top">i love it, i don''t know about the wing though. Maybe you intentionally did that. But otherwise great shot :)</td>', 'i love it, i don''t know about the wing though. Maybe you intentionally did that. But otherwise great shot :)', '2007-12-16 10:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
