(4318681, 621362, 44628, '<td valign="top">It''s not that I disagree with the message, but it is a rather simple snap shot of an over the road truck</td>', 'It''s not that I disagree with the message, but it is a rather simple snap shot of an over the road truck', '2007-12-17 12:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318859, 621399, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love these "God rays".  Every time I see them I''m searching for a place to get off the road to grab a shot.  :-)  In your shot here I like how you can see just a peek into the blue skies above.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.  p.s. - my top pick.  :)</td>', 'I love these "God rays".  Every time I see them I''m searching for a place to get off the road to grab a shot.  :-)  In your shot here I like how you can see just a peek into the blue skies above.  Well done.  Good luck in the challenge.  p.s. - my top pick.  :)', '2007-12-17 14:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318863, 621719, 30049, '<td valign="top">I love the duotone color of blues in this.  I''m a sucker for blue/blk/wht combos anyway.  :)  Good choice in including the sun in the upper part of this IMO.  You''ll probably hear otherwise from the diverse group of photographers at DPC.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I love the duotone color of blues in this.  I''m a sucker for blue/blk/wht combos anyway.  :)  Good choice in including the sun in the upper part of this IMO.  You''ll probably hear otherwise from the diverse group of photographers at DPC.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-12-17 14:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4318872, 621376, 30049, '<td valign="top">Quite an emotive shot here.  I imagine a wide range of comments &amp; opinions are showing up on this one.  Subject-wise it fits the challenge just fine for me.  Photographically, the DOF works and it''s well focused.  The bg seam is a distraction that may have been eliminated with a seamless bg or a slight adjustment using curves.  Nonetheless, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Quite an emotive shot here.  I imagine a wide range of comments & opinions are showing up on this one.  Subject-wise it fits the challenge just fine for me.  Photographically, the DOF works and it''s well focused.  The bg seam is a distraction that may have been eliminated with a seamless bg or a slight adjustment using curves.  Nonetheless, good luck in the challenge.', '2007-12-17 14:09:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4319025, 621484, 23484, '<td valign="top">Christian, you''re one of the few that I think really met the challenge well. Good job.</td>', 'Christian, you''re one of the few that I think really met the challenge well. Good job.', '2007-12-17 15:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
