(4322294, 621540, 51793, '<td valign="top">Hey man congratulations on you''re first blue. I must say that I love your style of photography and I knew that you would start getting ribbons very soon, well it''s about time. This one is a bit shy on score because it should have been a high 7. Still you won it man. Good work.</td>', 'Hey man congratulations on you''re first blue. I must say that I love your style of photography and I knew that you would start getting ribbons very soon, well it''s about time. This one is a bit shy on score because it should have been a high 7. Still you won it man. Good work.', '2007-12-19 06:59:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4322307, 621722, 51793, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe that a D40x put out an image of this quality. Make sure that your ISO setting is on 100, or 200 when shooting something like this. If it''s on auto you will get these very grainy shots. And you could have edited this differently getting the same results without getting DQ''d. <br/> <br/>Which btw sorry for the DQ.</td>', 'I can''t believe that a D40x put out an image of this quality. Make sure that your ISO setting is on 100, or 200 when shooting something like this. If it''s on auto you will get these very grainy shots. And you could have edited this differently getting the same results without getting DQ''d.  Which btw sorry for the DQ.', '2007-12-19 07:10:35.000000', NULL, 0),
