(4323646, 621327, 85733, '<td valign="top">Good job. My initial though was a high edited image, but after reading your description, I can just say "well thought, well executed".</td>', 'Good job. My initial though was a high edited image, but after reading your description, I can just say "well thought, well executed".', '2007-12-19 15:01:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4323807, 621327, 70036, '<td valign="top">Would love to see you re-edit this using all the tools.  It deserves the full treatment.  Great photo and great imagination and use of flare and long exposure.  I know it is very tedious to get it right when you know you cannot use advanced editing.   Great job.</td>', 'Would love to see you re-edit this using all the tools.  It deserves the full treatment.  Great photo and great imagination and use of flare and long exposure.  I know it is very tedious to get it right when you know you cannot use advanced editing.   Great job.', '2007-12-19 15:47:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(4323870, 621409, 66253, '<td valign="top">Oh, cool! I''ve been fascinated by that underground walkway for as long as it''s existed. I remember when they first opened it, they had a negative reaction to the weird music that played; people found it too disorienting. I don''t know whether what they play now is much better; I fear it''s spoiled "An American in Paris" for me for good.<br/> <br/>It must have been a quiet time of day for no one to topple your tripod. On the other hand, maybe not too quiet, or someone would have wanted to officially know why you kept riding the moving walkways back and forth! ;^)</td>', 'Oh, cool! I''ve been fascinated by that underground walkway for as long as it''s existed. I remember when they first opened it, they had a negative reaction to the weird music that played; people found it too disorienting. I don''t know whether what they play now is much better; I fear it''s spoiled "An American in Paris" for me for good. It must have been a quiet time of day for no one to topple your tripod. On the other hand, maybe not too quiet, or someone would have wanted to officially know why you kept riding the moving walkways back and forth! ;^)', '2007-12-19 16:06:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4324383, 621327, 53316, '<td valign="top">I''m glad it wasn''t advanced - I think it looks raw and real, but of course with the lens flare, very magical.  Glad to see this in the top.</td>', 'I''m glad it wasn''t advanced - I think it looks raw and real, but of course with the lens flare, very magical.  Glad to see this in the top.', '2007-12-19 18:36:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4324392, 621376, 53316, '<td valign="top">Heh, definitely got marked down for the religious aspect - all those 1s, 2s, and 3s.  But I think the overall score is a fair one; as people said, the background was a bit distracting.  Anyway, great image, and one of my top picks for the challenge - thank you for sharing it with us.</td>', 'Heh, definitely got marked down for the religious aspect - all those 1s, 2s, and 3s.  But I think the overall score is a fair one; as people said, the background was a bit distracting.  Anyway, great image, and one of my top picks for the challenge - thank you for sharing it with us.', '2007-12-19 18:40:18.000000', NULL, 0),
