(4324427, 620027, 53316, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness!  I gave this one of my handfull of 10s. I thought it was perfect.  The "softness" (unfocusedness, lack of definition, whatever) of the clouds gave this such a wonderful abstract feel and I thought that really fit with the theme of "heaven".</td>', 'Oh my goodness!  I gave this one of my handfull of 10s. I thought it was perfect.  The "softness" (unfocusedness, lack of definition, whatever) of the clouds gave this such a wonderful abstract feel and I thought that really fit with the theme of "heaven".', '2007-12-19 18:50:37.000000', NULL, 0),
