(4324877, 620914, 47852, '<td valign="top">I''m glad you left this shot in for the challenge... definitely steps outside the boundaries of the typical DPC winning shots!  I tacked an extra point onto my vote for you since you had the guts to enter this, knowing it probably wouldn''t score well (which made this one of my top 2 rated shots)!  I''m glad to see that others took the time to look past the initial unexpected blur and liked it as much as I did, but still disappointed to see it place where it did.<br/> <br/>I do like the other watercolor version that you did, but for me it goes a bit too far.  I think I''d maybe prefer something that is in the middle of the two versions?</td>', 'I''m glad you left this shot in for the challenge... definitely steps outside the boundaries of the typical DPC winning shots!  I tacked an extra point onto my vote for you since you had the guts to enter this, knowing it probably wouldn''t score well (which made this one of my top 2 rated shots)!  I''m glad to see that others took the time to look past the initial unexpected blur and liked it as much as I did, but still disappointed to see it place where it did. I do like the other watercolor version that you did, but for me it goes a bit too far.  I think I''d maybe prefer something that is in the middle of the two versions?', '2007-12-19 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 0),
